    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5286" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμίμητος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
